OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to former deputy
OL,4,AMike O'Hara
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former government minister who has
OL,7,Fdied has been remembered for his "sunny
OL,8,Fpersonality and unrelenting optimism".
OL,10,FFormer Guernsey deputy, Mike O'Hara,
OL,11,Fdied at the age of 76 on 30 October.
OL,13,FHe was first elected to the States of
OL,14,FGuernsey in 2001 and was probably best
OL,15,Fknown for this role as the Culture &
OL,16,FLeisure minister with his support for
OL,17,FLiberation Day, and bringing a
OL,18,Fskatepark to the island.
