OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to former deputy
OL,4,AMike O'Hara
OL,5,
OL,6,FOutside politics, he was instrumental
OL,7,Fin setting up the Dyslexia Day Centre
OL,8,Fin 1987. Father of the House, Deputy
OL,9,FJohn Gollop said O'Hara was "a
OL,10,Fgentleman".
